Subject: confidence bands for logistic regression when data is fraction of success
Message-ID: <fVxyCVZ-QC8.MCVdmWEyGQAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/fVxyCVZ-QC8/m/MCVdmWEyGQAJ>
